            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Swarmwalker"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Swarms of animals and other unintelligent creatures instinctively leave a wihsaak alone. A wihsaak is immune to the damage from and effects of swarms with an Intelligence of \u20135."
            },
