        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Droning Distraction"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, divine, evocation, incapacitation, mental)\n\nThe wihsaak beats its wings rapidly, creating a buzzing drone that numbs creatures' minds. Each creature within 100 feet must attempt a DC 23 Will save. They are then temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected.\nFailure: The creature is confused and stupefied 1 for 1 round.\nCritical Failure: The creature is confused for 1 round and stupefied 2 for 1 minute."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "a7cb8cdc-3f8f-4fdf-a5ac-85e2fa5a0825",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:27.494111"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Skip Between"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, divine, teleportation)\n\nThe sahkil moves from the Material Plane to the Ethereal Plane or vice-versa, with the effects of ethereal jaunt except that the effect has an unlimited duration and can be Dismissed. A summoned sahkil can't use Skip Between."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
